    question: 'Explain the importance of mathematical statistics in data science.',
    answer:
      '**Statistics:** data ko collect, summarise, model karke uncertainty ke saath conclusion nikaalna.\n\n**Importance (6 points):**\n1. Data summarise — mean, median, variance, IQR\n2. Sampling — representative sample aur CLT\n3. Uncertainty quantify — confidence interval, standard error\n4. Decision validate — hypothesis test, A/B test, p-value\n5. Modelling — regression assumptions, bias-variance, overfitting\n6. Galat conclusion se bachana — correlation vs causation, biased data\n\n**Statistics ke bina:** result ka bharosa pata nahi chalta, noise ko insight samajh liya jaata hai, chhote sample par bada decision.\n\n**Statistics ke saath:** significance pata chalti hai, estimate ke saath error band milta hai, overfitting detect hota hai.\n\n**Formulas:** mean μ = Σx/n · σ = √(Σ(x−μ)²/n) · z = (x−μ)/σ · p < 0.05 significant.\n\n**Diagram:** Refer to the statistics pyramid diagram.',
